flowchart LR
    A[Business task] --> B[Draft system prompt]
    B --> C[Add schema + examples]
    C --> D[Run against test set]
    D --> E{Pass evaluation?}
    E -->|No| F[Identify failure mode]
    F --> B
    E -->|Yes| G[Register agent / deploy]
    G --> H[Monitor production events]
    H --> F

    style A fill:#151517,stroke:#3f3f46,color:#e5e5e5
    style E fill:#ec4899,stroke:#f472b6,color:#fff
    style G fill:#22c55e,stroke:#4ade80,color:#fff
